---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms & Conditions — All Calc Kit" 
  description="Terms of service and usage conditions for All Calc Kit free online calculator and unit conversion suite."
  canonicalUrl="https://allcalckit.com/terms"
>
  <!-- Hero Header -->
  <section class="border-b border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-50/50 dark:bg-neutral-950/50 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <!-- Breadcrumb -->
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 mb-6">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-black dark:hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-black dark:text-white font-semibold">Terms & Conditions</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <span class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider inline-block">
          Terms of Service
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-black dark:text-white">
          Terms & Conditions.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl font-medium">
          Effective Date: August 6, 2026. Please read these terms carefully before using All Calc Kit.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content Section -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16 space-y-10 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
    
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing or using <strong>All Calc Kit</strong> (located at <code>allcalckit.com</code>), you agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions. If you do not agree to all terms, please refrain from accessing or using our services.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white">2. Description of Service & Free Use</h2>
      <p>
        All Calc Kit provides free client-side online converters and mathematical calculators for personal, educational, professional, and commercial use. The platform requires no subscription, account creation, or payment.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white">3. Calculation Accuracy Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        While we strive for 100% mathematical precision and utilize internationally recognized standards (such as WHO BMI benchmarks and live currency market rates), all calculation results are provided for informational and educational purposes only.
      </p>
      <div class="p-4 bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-neutral-900 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 text-xs font-mono">
        <strong>Disclaimer:</strong> Users should independently verify critical financial loan repayments, tax obligations, engineering specifications, or medical advice before making binding commitments.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        The All Calc Kit trademark, logo design, user interface assets, original content, and custom source code are the intellectual property of All Calc Kit. You may not frame, duplicate, or scrape site content without explicit written consent.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        In no event shall All Calc Kit, its operators, or contributors be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from the use or inability to use our tools.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white">6. Modifications to Terms</h2>
      <p>
        We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. Continued use of the website following any posted modifications constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-black dark:text-white text-base">Questions regarding our Terms?</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">Reach out directly via our contact form.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/contact" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-black dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-black font-semibold text-xs hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity whitespace-nowrap">
        Contact Support →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
